          <Pad Id="LXEHLWG6aPKSlYFVxsYZPC" Bounds="540,940,320,45" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="&lt;- the only per-tile numbers the shader needs are x, y and zoom. Everything else about WHERE the tile is on the earth is arithmetic the GPU does once per vertex.">
